		{"id":"sources","type":"text","x":0,"y":20,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"5","text":"### Corporate sources\n\nOfficial records stay outside the brain.\n\n[Integration register](../04-architecture/integrations.md)"},
		{"id":"examples","type":"text","x":0,"y":220,"width":320,"height":170,"color":"5","text":"### Source examples\n\nNotion · GitHub · Calendar / Artemis · Slack\n\nIllustrative; connections pending."},
