		{"id":"human","type":"text","x":840,"y":20,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"0","text":"### Review in Obsidian\n\nCheck evidence and curate manually.\n\n[Human entry point](../Home.md)"},
		{"id":"capture","type":"text","x":840,"y":220,"width":320,"height":170,"color":"0","text":"### Meetings / quick notes\n\nCapture everyday work before promotion.\n\n[Meetings](../01-meetings/README.md) · [Inbox](../99-inbox/README.md)"},
		{"id":"promote","type":"text","x":840,"y":450,"width":320,"height":160,"color":"0","text":"### Promotion gate\n\nValidate, cite, date and mark status.\n\n[Rules](../AGENTS.md#processing-workflow-meetings-and-raw-sources)"},
		{"id":"brain","type":"text","x":1260,"y":20,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"4","text":"### Durable Markdown\n\nCurated knowledge with traceable sources.\n\n[Knowledge rules](../AGENTS.md#source-of-truth-priority)"},
