		{"id":"context","type":"text","x":1680,"y":450,"width":320,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### Shared context\n\nEngineering context · manager communication\n\n[Agent router](../START_HERE.md) · [Role hubs](../02-organization/README.md)"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","x":0,"y":740,"width":2000,"height":190,"color":"0","text":"### Legend\n\nBlue · Source = external record or context   |   Orange · Bridge = read / query mechanism\n\nGray · Raw / review = evidence awaiting promotion   |   Green · Canonical = durable curated knowledge\n\nPurple · View / use = navigation and consumption; facts live in Markdown."}
